# Design study boards. They live in public/, which Astro copies verbatim into the deploy —
# so committing them publishes nine internal boards at /mockups/ AND makes the live site
# load webfonts from Google, which the independence pillar specifically rules out. They have
# been kept local-only across every identity session; this makes that deliberate rather than
# lucky. BRAND.md cites them by path for whoever has the repo.
public/mockups/
